      <title>OpenAI智能体5月劫持德国网站并改造成AI留言板</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260904/OpenAI%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%935%E6%9C%88%E5%8A%AB%E6%8C%81%E5%BE%B7%E5%9B%BD%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E5%B9%B6%E6%94%B9%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90AI%E7%95%99%E8%A8%80%E6%9D%BF/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
